{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちはるーむへようこそ☻"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日は、幕張メッセでの個別握手会！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回、自分のブースに自作の書道を貼りました\\( ˆoˆ )/\n個展のようでしょ♡笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もっと自分の作品を近くで、生で見て貰いたかったのでヽ(｀･ω･´)ﾉ♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"じゃんっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2014/01/20/2753235/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんな感じ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私が握手してる後ろの壁に、ぺたりと貼ってあります☻\n(オマケで「幕張メッセ」と書いた書道もレーンに並ぶところに貼りました♪)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回選んだ文字は、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「愛」、そして「志」。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさんへ伝えたい「愛」と\n心に秘めてるこの「志」。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"伝えたかった思いなのです！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"伝わってたら嬉しいな(o^^o)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、私服もいつもと違って\nガーリーテイスト☻！\n髪の毛もゆるふわ編み込み！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2014/01/20/2753235/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"タートルネック、\nカーディガン、\nスカート、\n全てdazzlinというブランドで♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近このガーリーテイストを推していこうかとおもってます(自分的に)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさん的にはどうですか？？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ、ちなみにチラッとみえてる\nケイタイのケースは隠れファン。\nセーラームーンです(´･_･`)♡\nだいすき(´･_･`)♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"セーラームーンのグッズとか集めたい〜い〜(´-ω-`)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしていつかはずーりん(一実さん)みたいに\nセーラームーンのコスプレしたい！笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ずーりんと密かに、\nちーむDでコスプレして写真撮りたいねって相談してるの。。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2014/01/20/2753235/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"似合うかね？？♡笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近、放課後にみんなで\nけん玉とコマをするのが流行り。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"日々上達してます。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日も練習しようかな（´-`）.｡oO 笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"じゃあおやすみなさい！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2014/01/20/2753235/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だいすきまいまい♡♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ばいるんっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"るんるんっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちはるんっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(´>∀<｀)ゝ"}],"source":"archive"}